              "date": "2024-12-30T06:30:00+00:00",
              "review": "\"\"\"I recently traveled with India Tour Expeditions Pvt. Ltd., and while the overall experience was great, I have a few concerns. Being from Gujarat, I found the food options to be average and not very suitable for my taste.\n\nWe also faced issues during our ATV rides at Doodhpathri, as the instructor should guide us about the areas open in winter, which affected our bargaining. Additionally, during heavy snowfall, we were stuck for 14-15 hours at night, and I feel the company should have arranged our stay at Pahalgam for better safety and comfort. And one more company must improve the time management at trip.\n\nOverall, a great trip and also very well enjoyed with our leader Krishnabhai just faced this small problems company should work for it.😄😄\"",
