              "review": "\"I recently embarked on a kashmir tour with India Tour Expeditions, and it was an incredible experience! The entire trip was well-organized, from transportation to accommodations and daily itineraries.\n\nEvery spot, from shrinagar to pahelgav, was breathtaking, and the team ensured we had enough time to explore and soak in the beauty.\n\nOur trip leader Krishna Vairagi was friendly and provided fascinating insights about the region's culture, history, and lifestyle, making the journey even more enriching.\n\nDespite the remote terrain, accommodations were cozy and clean, and meals were wholesome and catered to everyone's preferences.\n\nOverall, I would highly recommend India Tour Expeditions for anyone planning to explore Winter kashmir .\n\nOur trip leader was super fun...he was chill and cracking jokes. He was not a buzz kill like some leaders are. We had a lot of fun in the travllers as well as in hotels to...\"",
