              "review": "\"We just had our first experience with India Tour for our Winter Kashmir Trip. We never do Group trips, and it was our first Group trip as well. But kudos to our trip leader Kevin, we couldn't have had a better trip to Kashmir. The trip leader made sure everyone in the group was individually cared for and was having fun. Everyone in the group was super accommodating & friendly, so it felt like we were travelling with friends we just hadn't met in a while. India Tour made sure the itinerary was well executed from before the trip too, and both our trip leader made sure all of us were comfortable from reaching the start point in Srinagar in the beginning to getting our cabs for our flights on time in the end.\n\nThe trip was well planned and superbly executed by the team without any hiccups even though we were a fairly large group. The highlight of the trip for us was Gulmarg and Doodhpathri without doubt, where we enjoyed the most.\n\nWe can't wait to visit Kashmir and other places with India Tour again!\"",
