            "review": "\"I went on their group kashmir trip with my 2 friends.\nDue to unavoidable circumstances we reached a day before everyone and had to leave a day earlier as well.\nBut the team cooperated very well with us in arranging their itinerary according to our needs despite it been a group trip with 14 other participants.\nNo where did we face any major consequences or glitches or delays in our whole journey with them.\nEveryone was ready to answer our queries and make our experience as smooth as possible.\nOf course for 2 days we had to adjust and be on our own, again due to unavoidable reasons but even then our safety and priorities were met with care.\nI also will give a thumbs up to our group leader Mr. Krishna for helping us throughout the trip in all circumstances(whether it was arranging our itinerary for solo one day excrusion of srinagar or helping us find suitable contacts while travelling to gulmarg on our own and even helping with the transfer to airpot).\nA big shout out to our driver Mr. Sajad as well who made our trip easy, fun and memorable.\nAll in all it was an experience in itself, not everything went as expected but it did not go any worse either.\nWe had the most memorable time of our lives and i thank you for that.\"",
