            "date": "2025-03-08T06:30:00+00:00",
            "review": "\"Vrey good experiencesOur corporate trip to Kashmir with India Tour Expeditions was nothing short of magical! From the moment we landed, everything was perfectly arranged. The views of the snow-capped mountains, the peaceful lakes, and the charming local culture made it an unforgettable experience. The highlight of our trip was the Shikara ride and the breathtaking landscapes of Gulmarg.\n\nThe team at India Tour Expeditions ensured we had a smooth and comfortable journey. Every little detail was taken care of, making our trip stress-free and enjoyable. We truly appreciate their effort and would love to travel with them again!\"",
            "tourBooked": "Kashmir Winter Trip from Delhi",
