            "userPhoto": "https://d37ng3z2ha8i9t.cloudfront.net/review/d12de95d-503f-4f57-b348-61d639e07cfe",
            "rating": 5,
            "date": "2025-03-01T06:30:00+00:00",
            "review": "\"We recently had an amazing trip to Kashmir, and choosing India Tour Expeditions for our travel arrangements was the best decision. The trip planned by India Tour was exceptional. We also wanted to visit Vaishno Devi during our trip, and team helped us plan it in such a way that we could cover both Kashmir and the Darshan at Vaishno Devi comfortably, allowing us to rest after the journey.\nWe prefer Jain food, and team did an excellent job fulfilling this requirement. All the hotels booked for our stay were fantastic, with good heating facilities to combat the cold weather in Kashmir. The drivers for our internal journeys were also courteous and helpful.\nOverall, we had a wonderful experience with India Tour. Thank you India Tour specially Sameer and Harsh for organizing such an amazing trip.\"",
