            "review": "\"It was my best trip and have grate experience. Thank you India Tour Expedition for this amazing trip. Kashmir is truly heaven on earth. And I saw it with help of India Tour Expedition. We had visited gulmarg, sonmarg, pahalgam, srinagar and all places are speech less and our trip leader \"\"kevinbhai\"\" was also so helpful and kind.\nThank you again India Tour Expedition for give us great experience.\"",
