            "date": "2025-03-18T06:30:00+00:00",
            "review": "\"It's a good experience to go out first Trip through India Tour Expedition. It was memorable trip to Kashmir and totally worth it. India Tour made it so easy without any trouble during trip.\nOur tour guide Samir and Avdhesh have much support during trip in spite of problem during check in Gulmarg Hotel.\nThey have managed it very nicely nd fulfil our commitment for stay in Hotel.\nHotels, Food are good and up to mark at Kashmir in Srinagar, Pahalgam and Gulmarg.\nOne suggestion is that don't choose night stay in House boat as they are not providing facilities as like Hotel.\nRoom heater is not adequate, There is no variety in food. Water bottle have to purchase on own. Staff is very rude. We've faces too cold here to stay. Better to choose hotel in Srinagar instead to stay in Houseboat. Houseboat experience makes you frustrated in anytime in your Trip.\nWe just booked this trip without any personal reference to India Tour but they made us right to choose it.\nThanks to Aditi Raval for suggest Nd recommend India Tour for travel to Kashmir\nLooking forward to go by India Tour in Future.\"",
