            "rating": 5,
            "date": "2025-11-15T06:30:00+00:00",
            "review": "It won't be wrong to say India Tour Expeditions is synonymous with great experiences.\n\nKey Highlights:\n1. Food Quality: Great food at all stays, up to the mark or even better.\n2. Driving Experience: Driver our professional executive chauffeur  ensured smooth travel and really let us felt that Kashmir is a ' Paradise on earth'.\n3. Stay: Decent stays were provided to us all throughout the journey with supportive staff.\n4. The manager was a call away which made it us for us to approach at difficult times too.\n\nIndia Tour has been an experience I would like to come back to again and refer to friends.\n",
