        "publish_date": "2025-03-18T06:30:00+00:00",
        "review": "\"We booked our trip through this travel agency and had a mixed experience.\n•\tSrinagar (OV Boutique Hotel): Had a good stay, comfortable and well-managed.\n•\tPahalgam: Experience was average, nothing exceptional.\n•\tHouseboat: Disappointed with the houseboat stay, not up to expectations.\n•\tDriver: The driver provided was good and cooperative.\n•\tGulmarg Hotel: Initially, we were given a single family room for 7 people, which was inconvenient. However, after raising the issue, they managed to adjust things.\n\nOverall, there were some issues, but the agency was quick to respond and resolve problems.\nA decent experience,\"",
