          "routeSummary": "",
          "overviewText": "Enjoy an idyllic mix of coastal relaxation and city discovery on India Tour's **Bangkok Pattaya Tour Package**. This 5-day, 4-night adventure takes you from Pattaya’s sandy beaches and crystal-clear waters to Bangkok’s vibrant streets and spiritual landmarks. Highlights include the **Coral Island Tour by Speedboat** and a **Bangkok City Tour**, making it ideal for families, couples, and groups.\n\nWith **comfortable stays, seamless transfers, daily breakfast**, and hassle-free sightseeing, this package ensures a stress-free and unforgettable Thailand holiday.\n\n\n### Why Travelers Love the Bangkok Pattaya Tour Package\n### \n- **All-Inclusive Convenience:** Airport pickups, transfers, stays, sightseeing, and meals—all covered.\n- **Perfect for Any Group Size:** Packages for 2, 4, or 6 travelers.\n- **Adventure & Leisure:** Enjoy speedboat tours, snorkeling, sightseeing, and free leisure time.\n- **Carefully Planned Experience:** Balanced itinerary ensures both beach fun and cultural exploration.\n\n\n### Top Experiences on This Bangkok Pattaya Trip\n### \n- **Coral Island Tour by Speedboat:** Cruise to the beautiful Coral Island from Pattaya, swim in turquoise waters, snorkel among vibrant marine life, and enjoy a local lunch.\n- **Bangkok City Tour:** Discover the spiritual heart of Bangkok with visits to iconic temples, bustling markets, and cultural landmarks.\n- **Beach & Leisure Time:** Relax on Pattaya’s golden sands, explore local attractions, or try optional water sports.\n\n\n### Accommodation & Comfort\n### \nEnjoy a comfortable stay throughout your Bangkok-Pattaya journey:\n\n- **Pattaya:** 2 nights in hotels near beaches and local attractions.\n- **Bangkok:** 2 nights in centrally located hotels with modern amenities.\n- **Daily Breakfast:** Included to start your day fresh and energized.\n- **Seamless Transfers:** Airport pickups, drops, and Pattaya-Bangkok transfers included.",
