          "routeSummary": "",
          "overviewText": "Discover the finest urban sights and pristine island waters with India Tour's **Discover Bangkok & Pattaya Tour Package**. Over 6 days and 5 nights, explore Pattaya’s golden beaches, enjoy thrilling Coral Island excursions, experience the vibrant Alcazar Cabaret Show, and immerse yourself in Bangkok’s cultural and urban attractions.\n\nThis package also includes a **FREE visit to Safari World & Marine Park**, making it perfect for families, couples, and groups who want a mix of adventure, culture, and wildlife in one seamless trip.\n\nWith **comfortable stays, hassle-free transfers, daily breakfast**, and carefully planned sightseeing, this is your chance to enjoy a stress-free and unforgettable Thailand holiday.\n\n\n### Why Travelers Love the Discover Bangkok & Pattaya Tour Package\n\n- **All-Inclusive Comfort:** Airport pickups, intercity transfers, accommodation, sightseeing, and meals—all taken care of.\n- **Flexible Group Options:** Packages available for 2, 4, or 6 travelers, suitable for couples, families, and friends.\n- **Adventure & Entertainment:** Coral Island tour, Alcazar Show, city sightseeing, and wildlife adventure at Safari World.\n- **Perfectly Balanced Itinerary:** Combines beach fun, cultural experiences, leisure time, and wildlife adventure.\n\n\n### Top Experiences on This Bangkok & Pattaya Trip\n### \n- **Coral Island Tour by Speedboat:** Swim, snorkel, and relax on the beautiful Coral Island with a local lunch included.\n- **Alcazar Cabaret Show:** Enjoy a dazzling evening performance showcasing Thailand’s famous cabaret culture.\n- **Bangkok City Tour:** Explore temples, markets, and city highlights during a half-day tour.\n- **Safari World & Marine Park:** A full-day wildlife experience with animals, shows, and interactive activities perfect for families and kids.\n- **Leisure Days:** Relax at Pattaya’s beaches or explore local attractions at your own pace.\n\n\n### Accommodation & Comfort\n### \nEnjoy a comfortable stay throughout your Bangkok-Pattaya journey:\n\n- **Pattaya:** 3 nights in hotels near beaches and attractions\n- **Bangkok:** 2 nights in centrally located hotels with modern amenities\n- **Daily Breakfast:** Energizing mornings at all hotels\n- **Seamless Transfers:** Airport pickups, drops, and Pattaya-Bangkok transfers included",
