          "overviewText": "This **8 days / 7 nights Thailand tour package** is designed for travellers who want to experience Thailand’s most popular highlights in one well-planned journey. Covering **Bangkok, Krabi, and Phuket**, the trip brings together cultural sightseeing, wildlife experiences, scenic islands, and relaxed beach time.\n\nThe package focuses on comfort and smooth travel, with hotels, transfers, daily breakfast, and sightseeing arranged in advance—allowing you to enjoy your Thailand holiday without worrying about logistics.\n\n\n### **Destinations & What You Experience**\n### \n#### **Bangkok**\n#### \nThailand’s capital offers a blend of culture, modern city life, and unique experiences. The trip includes guided sightseeing to explore major landmarks and local areas, a visit to **Safari World & Marine Park** for wildlife encounters, and a relaxing **Chao Phraya River Dinner Cruise** that showcases Bangkok’s skyline and riverside charm.\n\n#### **Krabi**\n#### \nKrabi is known for its dramatic limestone cliffs, clear waters, and peaceful coastal atmosphere. Here, you experience the popular **4 Island Tour by Long Tail Boat**, covering scenic islands with time for swimming and snorkeling. The **Krabi Jungle Tour** adds a different dimension with waterfalls, forests, and natural viewpoints.\n\n#### **Phuket**\n#### \nPhuket combines island scenery with local culture. The tour includes a guided **Phuket City Tour** to explore viewpoints and local markets, along with a **Phi Phi Island Tour by Speedboat**, offering clear waters, stunning limestone formations, and famous spots like Maya Bay.\n\n### **Experiences Included in the Thailand Tour Package**\n### \n- Guided Bangkok city sightseeing\n- Safari World & Marine Park visit\n- Chao Phraya River Dinner Cruise\n- 4 Island Tour in Krabi by Long Tail Boat\n- Krabi Jungle Tour\n- Phuket City Tour\n- Phi Phi Island Tour by Speedboat\n\nEach experience is scheduled with adequate time in between, ensuring the trip remains enjoyable and not overly rushed.\n\n### **Accommodation & Travel Comfort**\n### \n- **Total Nights:** 7 nights across Bangkok, Krabi, and Phuket\n- **Hotel Category:** Comfortable, well-located properties with modern amenities\n- **Daily Breakfast:** Included at all hotels\n- **Transfers:**\n    - Airport pickup and drop\n    - Intercity transfers between Bangkok, Krabi, and Phuket\n- **On-Trip Convenience:** All major sightseeing and transport pre-arranged\n\n\n### **Who This Thailand Tour Package Is Ideal For**\n### \n- Couples looking for a mix of romance, sightseeing, and beach time\n- Families wanting variety without fast-paced travel\n- Groups seeking shared experiences with flexible comfort\n\nThe package can be arranged for **2, 4, or 6 travellers** and customised based on hotel preference and travel dates.\n\n\n### **Why Choose This Thailand Tour Package**\n\n- Covers Thailand’s top city and island destinations in one trip\n- Includes wildlife, island tours, and cultural experiences\n- Well-balanced travel pace with leisure time\n- Hassle-free planning with all major inclusions covered",
