          "location": "Private Tour",
          "routeSummary": "",
          "overviewText": "The **9 days / 8 nights Majestic Thailand Tour Package** is ideal for travellers who want a deeper and more immersive Thailand experience. Covering **Bangkok, Krabi, and Phuket**, this journey blends cultural sightseeing, wildlife encounters, island adventures, and relaxed beach time.\n\nWith carefully planned inclusions such as comfortable hotel stays, smooth transfers, daily breakfast, and curated sightseeing, the package ensures a stress-free Thailand holiday suitable for families, couples, and group travellers.\n\n\n### **Destinations & What You Experience**\n### \n#### **Bangkok**\n#### \nBangkok introduces you to Thailand’s cultural and urban charm. The experience includes guided city sightseeing covering temples, markets, and key landmarks, along with a relaxing **Chao Phraya River Dinner Cruise** that offers scenic views of the city at night. A full-day visit to **Safari World & Marine Park** adds a fun and interactive wildlife element to the trip.\n\n#### **Krabi**\n#### \nKrabi brings in nature, islands, and outdoor experiences. The **7 Island Tour by Long Tail Boat** takes you across some of the region’s most scenic islands, with time for swimming and snorkeling. The **Krabi Jungle Tour** offers a contrast with lush greenery, waterfalls, and natural viewpoints.\n\n#### **Phuket**\n#### \nPhuket combines island scenery with wildlife and local culture. The package includes a guided **Phuket City Tour** covering viewpoints and cultural spots, along with a visit to **Tiger Kingdom Phuket**, one of the highlights for wildlife enthusiasts. The **Phi Phi Island Tour by Speedboat** showcases Thailand’s iconic limestone cliffs, clear waters, and famous locations like Maya Bay.\n\n\n### **Experiences Included in the Majestic Thailand Package**\n### \n- Guided Bangkok city sightseeing\n- Chao Phraya River Dinner Cruise\n- Safari World & Marine Park visit\n- 7 Island Tour in Krabi by Long Tail Boat\n- Krabi Jungle Tour\n- Phuket City Tour\n- Tiger Kingdom Phuket visit\n- Phi Phi Island Tour by Speedboat\n\nAll experiences are spaced out to maintain a comfortable pace and allow time for relaxation.\n\n\n### **Accommodation & Travel Comfort**\n### \n- **Total Nights:** 8 nights across Bangkok, Krabi, and Phuket\n- **Bangkok:** 3 nights in centrally located hotels\n- **Krabi:** 2 nights near beaches and major attractions\n- **Phuket:** 3 nights in well-connected, modern hotels\n- **Daily Breakfast:** Included at all hotels\n- **Transfers:**\n    - Airport pickup and drop\n    - Intercity transfers between Bangkok, Krabi, and Phuket\n\n\n### **Who This Majestic Thailand Package Is Ideal For**\n### \n- Families looking for variety without rushed travel\n- Couples who want a mix of culture, beaches, and wildlife\n- Groups seeking shared experiences with flexible comfort\n\nThis package can be arranged for **2, 4, or 6 travellers** and customised based on hotel preferences and travel dates.\n\n\n### **Why Choose the Majestic Thailand Tour Package**\n### \n- Covers Thailand’s top city and island destinations\n- Includes premium wildlife experiences like Safari World and Tiger Kingdom\n- Balanced mix of sightseeing, adventure, and leisure\n- End-to-end planning for a smooth and hassle-free holiday",
