              "review": "“Our trip was perfectly planned by India Tour Expedition. From booking to sightseeing, everything was handled professionally. The staff was very friendly, supportive, and always available to help. They truly care about customer comfort and satisfaction. We enjoyed every moment of the trip. Thank you for making it memorable!” Specially thanks  to avadhesh patel for our best trip plan.",
