              "rating": 5,
              "date": "2026-03-29T06:30:00+00:00",
              "review": "Finally that was an end to an incredible trip of ours. ❤️\nFirst of all, thank you, India Tour Expeditions, for making this into much more beautiful reality. ✨\n\nI wanted to reach out and share our heartfelt thanks for the memorable trip you organised for us to Krabi/Phuket. From the moment we landed, everything was seamless. The accommodations were perfect, and every itinerary  you selected was knowledgeable and utmost coordination; everything was so so smooth that we hadn’t have to worry about anything, just to go with the beautiful flow… while contacting your team, I didn't have much idea about what was next, but the way you arranged everything according to the customisation just helped us to relax and enjoy the experience more. This was a bucket-list journey for us, and your attention to detail made it better than we ever imagined.\nOn this note, I would like to appreciate all the team members behind the trip for the fantastic teamwork and coordination, and Ms Anusree special thanks for everything, from being there throughout the trip helping with each and every small question and doubt that we had, hands-off for the dedication. ❤️✨\n\nAnd thank you so much, @~Santosh Bamne 🫡,⁩ for the last-minute hassle handled well. ✨\n\nWe can’t wait to book our next adventure with you!\"\n\nThank you once again. ❤️",
