        "routeSummary": "",
        "overviewText": "The **4 days / 3 nights Phuket Tour Package** is thoughtfully planned for travellers seeking an authentic, well-paced island getaway in Thailand. This package focuses on Phuket’s most iconic experiences, combining island hopping, cultural sightseeing, and relaxed beach time.\n\nCovering highlights like **[Phi Phi Island**, **James Bond Island**, and a guided **Phuket City Tour**, the trip is designed to give you a well-rounded Phuket experience without feeling rushed. Comfortable hotel stays, airport transfers, daily breakfast, and planned sightseeing ensure a smooth and enjoyable holiday.\n\n\n### **Destination & What You Experience**\n### \n#### **Phuket**\n#### \nPhuket is known for its turquoise waters, scenic islands, and lively coastal atmosphere. This package allows you to explore both the natural beauty and cultural side of the island. Speedboat tours take you to Thailand’s most famous islands, while the city tour introduces you to Phuket’s local markets, viewpoints, and cultural landmarks. Leisure time gives you the flexibility to relax on the beach or explore on your own.\n\n\n### **Experiences Included in the Package**\n### \n- Phi Phi Island Tour by Speedboat, including stops at Maya Bay and Bamboo Island\n- James Bond Island Tour by Speedboat, featuring dramatic limestone cliffs and emerald waters\n- Half-day Phuket City Tour covering cultural landmarks, local markets, and viewpoints\n- Free time to relax on beaches or explore Phuket independently\n\n\n### **Accommodation & Travel Comfort**\n### \n- **Total Nights:** 3 nights in Phuket\n- **Hotel Category:** Comfortable, well-located hotels with modern amenities\n- **Daily Breakfast:** Included at the hotel\n- **Transfers:**\n    - Airport pickup and drop\n    - Sightseeing and island tour transfers included\n\n\n### **Who This Phuket Package Is Ideal For**\n### \n- Couples looking for a short island escape\n- Families seeking a relaxed yet engaging beach holiday\n- Groups wanting an easy-paced Phuket trip\n\nThe package is suitable for **2, 4, or 6 travellers** and can be customised based on hotel preferences and travel dates.\n\n### **Why Choose This Phuket Tour Package**\n### \n- Covers Phuket’s most popular island and sightseeing experiences\n- Ideal duration for a short international holiday\n- Balanced mix of adventure, sightseeing, and leisure\n- Hassle-free planning with all major inclusions covered",
