        "id": 835,
        "name": "Khao Sok National Park",
        "brief": "One of the World’s Oldest Evergreen Rainforests",
        "description": "**Khao Sok National Park** is one of Thailand’s most spectacular natural destinations, known for its ancient rainforest, dramatic limestone cliffs, and the breathtaking **Cheow Lan Lake**. Located in southern Thailand, **Khao Sok Thailand** protects one of the **oldest rainforests in the world**, older even than the Amazon.\n\nThe park is famous for its emerald-green lake dotted with towering limestone karsts, **Khao Sok floating bungalows**, jungle trekking trails, and rich wildlife. A visit to **Khao Sok National Park** offers a completely different experience from Thailand’s beaches—focused on nature, serenity, and eco-adventure.\n\nThis guide covers everything you need to know about visiting **Khao Sok National Park**, including Cheow Lan Lake highlights, wildlife experiences, jungle activities, how to reach, and suggested itineraries.\n\n\n### Why Visit Khao Sok in Southern Thailand\n### \n- One of the **oldest rainforests on Earth**\n- Stunning **limestone karsts and rainforest cliffs**\n- Iconic **Cheow Lan Lake Khao Sok**\n- Unique **floating bungalow stays**\n- Rich wildlife including gibbons and hornbills\n- Ideal for nature lovers and slow travel\n\nFor Indian travellers, Khao Sok is perfect for those seeking offbeat, scenic, and peaceful experiences beyond cities and beaches.\n\n\n### Khao Sok National Park Location & Background\n### \n📍 Located in **Surat Thani Province**, southern Thailand\n- Covers over **700 sq km** of rainforest and lakes\n- Protected area since 1980\n\nThe park’s dramatic landscapes were formed millions of years ago, creating the iconic karst scenery seen today.\n\n\n### Cheow Lan Lake – Floating Bungalows, Limestone Cliffs and Boat Tours\n### \n**Cheow Lan Lake** is the heart of Khao Sok National Park.\n\n\n#### Viewpoints, Caves and Wildlife on the Lake\n#### \nHighlights of the lake experience include:\n\n- **Longtail boat tour Cheow Lan Lake**\n- Towering limestone peaks rising from the water\n- Stays in **Khao Sok floating bungalows**\n- Scenic **Khao Sok lake viewpoints and caves**\n- Early-morning mist and mirror-like reflections\n- Wildlife sightings such as **gibbons and hornbills**\n\nThe peaceful atmosphere makes Cheow Lan Lake one of Thailand’s most photogenic natural wonders.\n\n\n#### Jungle Trails, Canoeing and Wildlife Experiences\n#### \nBeyond the lake, Khao Sok offers immersive jungle activities.\n\nTop experiences include:\n\n- **Khao Sok jungle trekking** with local guides\n- **Wildlife spotting in Khao Sok** (gibbons, macaques, hornbills)\n- **Canoeing and kayaking among limestone peaks**\n- Night safaris and rainforest walks\n- Exploring caves and forest streams\n\n Wildlife encounters are common, especially during early mornings and evenings.\n\n\n### Best Time to Visit Khao Sok National Park\n### \n**Best Season:**\n\n✔️ November to April (dry season)\n\n**Green Season (May–Oct):**\n\n- Lush landscapes\n- Occasional rain\n- Fewer crowds\n\n Many travellers prefer the **best time to visit Khao Sok National Park dry season** for easier trekking and lake activities.\n\nDiscover Bangkok and Pattaya with India Tour Expeditions\n\n### How to Reach Khao Sok National Park\n### \n- From **Phuket**: 3–4 hours by road\n- From **Krabi**: 3–4 hours by road\n- From **Surat Thani**: 2–2.5 hours\n\nTravellers frequently search **how to get to Khao Sok from Phuket, Krabi or Surat Thani**, as road travel is the most convenient option.\n\n### Khao Sok National Park Tours & Floating Raft House Stays\n### \nPopular tour options include:\n\n- **Khao Sok National Park tours with Cheow Lan Lake**\n- **Khao Sok floating raft house overnight tour**\n- Guided jungle trekking packages\n- Lake + jungle combo experiences\n\n Overnight stays offer sunrise views, wildlife sounds, and complete immersion in nature.\n\n\n### Suggested Khao Sok Itineraries\n### \n**2 Days / 1 Night:**\n\n- Cheow Lan Lake boat tour\n- Floating bungalow stay\n- Cave visit and kayaking\n\n**3 Days / 2 Nights:**\n\n- Jungle trekking\n- Wildlife spotting\n- Canoeing and lake exploration\n\nThe **2 day 1 night Khao Sok lake package itinerary** is the most popular option for first-time visitors.\n\n\n### Tips for Visiting Khao Sok National Park\n### \n- Pack light, waterproof clothing\n- Carry insect repellent\n- Book tours in advance\n- Respect wildlife and park rules\n- Expect limited mobile network in remote areas\n\n Khao Sok is best enjoyed with a slow, nature-focused mindset.\n\n### Explore Khao Sok National Park with India Tour Expeditions\n### \nAt **India Tour Expeditions**, we curate immersive nature journeys for Indian travellers.\n\n✔️ **Khao Sok National Park tours**\n\n✔️ Cheow Lan Lake & floating bungalow stays\n\n✔️ Jungle trekking and eco-experiences\n\n✔️ Thailand tour packages from India\n\n🏞️ Add **Khao Sok National Park** to your Thailand itinerary and experience Thailand’s most breathtaking rainforest and lake landscapes.\n",
        "slug": "khao-sok-national-park",
