        "id": 338,
        "name": "Safari World and Marine Park",
        "brief": "Wildlife Park with Safari Drive, Animal Shows & Marine Life",
        "description": "**Safari World & Marine Park Bangkok** is Thailand’s most popular wildlife and family attraction, combining a **drive-through safari park** with an action-packed **marine park full of live shows and animal experiences**. Located on the outskirts of Bangkok, **Safari World Thailand** is a perfect day trip for families, couples, and first-time visitors travelling from India.\n\nSpread across a massive area, **Safari World and Marine Park** lets you see animals in open habitats, enjoy internationally famous shows like the **dolphin show, sea lion show, orangutan boxing**, and even feed giraffes up close. It’s one of the most searched family attractions in Bangkok and ideal if you’re travelling with kids.\n\n\n### Why Visit Safari World Bangkok\n### \n- Two attractions in one: **Safari Park + Marine Park**\n- Drive-thru safari with lions, tigers & giraffes\n- Famous **dolphin and sea lion shows**\n- Interactive animal feeding sessions\n- Highly **family-friendly attraction in Bangkok**\n- Easy half-day or full-day trip from the city\n\nFor Indian travellers planning a **Bangkok trip with kids**, Safari World is one of the safest and most entertaining choices.\n\n\n### Safari World Location & Layout\n### \n📍 **Safari World**, Bangkok (Min Buri area)\n- Approx. **45 km from central Bangkok**\n- Divided into:\n    -  **Safari Park** (drive-through)\n    -  **Marine Park** (walk-in shows & exhibits)\n\nMost visitors choose the **Safari World Marine Park combo ticket** for a complete experience.\n\n\n### Safari Park – Drive-Thru Wildlife Experience\n### \nThe **Safari Park Bangkok** is a drive-through zone where animals roam freely in large enclosures.\n\n**What You’ll See**\n\n- Lions and tigers\n- Giraffes and zebras\n- Rhinos, deer, and antelope\n- Bears and birds\n\nYou can enter using:\n\n- Safari World coach (recommended)\n- Private car or taxi\n\n **Giraffe feeding** is one of the most popular experiences and a highlight for families.\n\n\n### Marine Park Highlights – Shows & Attractions\n### \nThe **Safari World Marine Park** is where most of the entertainment happens.\n\n### Must-See Shows\n\n-  **Dolphin Show** – crowd favourite\n-  **Sea Lion Show**\n- **Elephant Show**\n-  **Orangutan Boxing Show**\n-  Bird Show\n-  **Spy War & Cowboy Stunt Show**\n\nThese shows run at fixed times throughout the day and are included in the **Safari World Bangkok shows** ticket.\n\n\n### Show Timetables & Extra Activities \n### \nPopular searches include **Safari World Bangkok opening hours shows timetable**.\n\n**Additional Experiences**\n\n- Jungle Cruise river ride\n- Marine aquarium\n- Animal photo sessions\n- Feeding zones (paid separately)\n\nArrive early to plan your show schedule and avoid missing performances.\n\n\n### Best Time to Visit Safari World Bangkok\n### \n✔️ **Best time of day:** Morning (8:30–10:00 AM)\n\n✔️ **Best days:** Weekdays (less crowded)\n\n✔️ **Best season:** November to February\n\nMorning visits allow you to:\n\n- See animals more active\n- Get better seating at shows\n- Avoid heat and crowds\n\n\n### Safari World Bangkok Tickets & Entry Options\n### \n Ticket options include:\n\n- Marine Park only\n- Safari Park only\n- **Safari World & Marine Park combo**\n- Add-ons like lunch buffet & transfers\n\nThe **Safari World Marine Park ticket price combo vs separate** usually offers better value.\n\n\n### How to Reach Safari World Bangkok\n### \n **By Road (Most Common)**\n\n- Taxi or private cab from Bangkok\n- Approx. 1–1.5 hours depending on traffic\n\n **From Suvarnabhumi Airport**\n\n- Around 45–60 minutes by car\n\nMany travellers search **how to reach Safari World from Suvarnabhumi Airport**, as it’s closer than the city centre.\n\n\n### Visiting Safari World with Family – Tips\n### \n- Wear comfortable shoes (long walking distances)\n- Carry hats & sunscreen\n- Keep water bottles handy\n- Plan shows in advance\n- Kids love giraffe feeding – don’t miss it\n\nSafari World is **ideal for families with children** and senior travellers.\n\n\n### Combine Safari World with Other Bangkok Attractions\n### \nSafari World is commonly combined with:\n\n- Bangkok city tour\n- Floating markets\n- Shopping at Platinum Mall / MBK\n- Evening cruise on Chao Phraya River\n\nIt fits perfectly into a **Bangkok 4–5 day itinerary**.\n\n\n### Book Safari World Bangkok with India Tour Expeditions\n### \nAt **India Tour Expeditions**, we curate seamless Thailand trips for Indian travellers.\n\n✔️ Safari World Bangkok tickets\n\n✔️ Marine Park show planning\n\n✔️ Private transfers from hotel\n\n✔️ Family-friendly Thailand itineraries\n\n🦁 Add **Safari World & Marine Park Bangkok** to your Thailand holiday for a fun-filled, unforgettable wildlife experience.",
