        "id": 808,
        "name": "Asiatique The Riverfront",
        "brief": "Riverside Night Market with Shopping, Dining & Entertainment",
        "description": "**Asiatique The Riverfront** is one of Bangkok’s most popular evening attractions, combining a lively night market with riverside dining and entertainment. Located along the **Chao Phraya River**, **Asiatique The Riverfront Thailand** offers a modern yet cultural shopping and leisure experience, making it a must-visit for travellers exploring Bangkok at night.\n\nUnlike traditional street markets, **Asiatique Bangkok** is well-organised, spacious, and family-friendly. With restored warehouses, open-air promenades, and river views, **Asiatique Riverfront Bangkok** is perfect for Indian travellers looking for relaxed nightlife, shopping, and entertainment in one place.\n\nThis guide covers everything you need to know about visiting **Asiatique The Riverfront**, including things to do, best time to visit, how to reach, and tips for families.\n\nCheck Phuket and Krabi Tour Package here!\n\n### Why Visit Asiatique The Riverfront Thailand\n### \n- One of the most popular **Bangkok night markets**\n- Beautiful **Chao Phraya riverfront market** setting\n- Mix of shopping, dining, and entertainment\n- Home to the famous **Asiatique Ferris Wheel Bangkok**\n- Hosts cultural shows like **Calypso Cabaret Asiatique**\n- Ideal **family-friendly Asiatique Bangkok** experience\n\nFor Indian travellers, Asiatique offers a safe, comfortable, and scenic night out in Bangkok.\n\n\n### Asiatique The Riverfront Location & Background\n### \n📍 Located along the **Chao Phraya River**, Bangkok\n- Developed from historic riverside warehouses\n- One of Bangkok’s most modern night markets\n\nAsiatique blends Bangkok’s trading heritage with contemporary shopping and entertainment.\n\n\n### Asiatique Bangkok Opening Hours and Best Time to Visit\n### \n**Opening Days:**\n\n✔️ Open daily\n\n**Asiatique Bangkok Opening Hours:**\n\n✔️ **4:00 PM – 12:00 Midnight**\n\nThe **best time to visit Asiatique Ferris Wheel at sunset** is between 6:00 PM and 7:00 PM, when the river views are at their best.\n\n\n### Things to Do at Asiatique The Riverfront\n### \nAsiatique offers a wide range of activities for all age groups.\n\n#### Asiatique Riverfront Shopping and Dining\n#### \n- Over 1,500 boutiques and souvenir shops\n- Thai handicrafts, fashion, and gifts\n- Riverside cafés and international restaurants\n- Ideal for relaxed evening shopping and dining\n\nThe **Asiatique riverfront shopping dining** experience is one of the highlights of the market.\n\nExperience the Best of Thailand with India Tour Expedition!\n\n#### Asiatique Ferris Wheel and Entertainment Shows\n#### \n- Iconic **Asiatique Ferris Wheel Bangkok** with panoramic river views\n- Popular **Calypso Cabaret Asiatique** cultural show\n- **Haunted House Mystery Mansion Asiatique** for thrill seekers\n- Live performances and street entertainment\n\nThese attractions make Asiatique more than just a shopping destination.\n\n\n### How to Reach Asiatique The Riverfront\n### \n- Take BTS Skytrain to **Saphan Taksin Station**\n- From **Sathorn Pier**, board the **free Asiatique shuttle boat**\n- Boat ride duration: approx. 10 minutes\n\nMany travellers search for **how to reach Asiatique Riverfront from Sathorn Pier**, as the free boat is the most scenic and convenient option.\n\n\n### Asiatique vs Chatuchak Night Market Bangkok\n### \n**Asiatique The Riverfront** offers a more relaxed, organised, and evening-focused experience with riverside views and entertainment, while **Chatuchak Night Market** is larger, more crowded, and better suited for bargain shopping during weekends.\n\nFor families and evening sightseeing, Asiatique is usually the preferred option.\n\n\n### Tips for Visiting Asiatique The Riverfront\n### \n- Visit after sunset for cooler weather\n- Combine with a Chao Phraya river cruise\n- Keep some cash for smaller vendors\n- Ferris wheel rides are best around sunset\n- Ideal place for **things to do at Asiatique with kids**\n\nPlan Bangkok and Pattaya Tour with India Tour \n\n### Explore Asiatique The Riverfront with India Tour Expeditions\n### \nAt **India Tour Expeditions**, we curate Bangkok experiences for Indian travellers.\n\n✔️ Bangkok night market visits\n\n✔️ Riverfront dining and entertainment\n\n✔️ Cultural shows like Calypso Cabaret\n\n✔️ Seamless Thailand travel planning\n\n🌃 Add **Asiatique The Riverfront Bangkok** to your Thailand itinerary and enjoy one of the city’s most scenic and family-friendly evening attractions.",
