        "id": 336,
        "name": "Coral Island",
        "brief": "Snorkelling & Water Sports Island Near Pattaya",
        "description": "**Coral Island Phuket**, also known as **Koh Hae**, is one of the closest and most popular island getaways from Phuket. Located just a short boat ride from the mainland, **Coral Island Thailand** is famous for its clear waters, vibrant coral reefs, and exciting water sports, making it an ideal **half-day or full-day island trip from Phuket**.\n\nDivided mainly into **Banana Beach Coral Island** and **Long Beach Coral Island**, the island offers a mix of adventure and relaxation. From snorkeling and swimming to parasailing and banana boat rides, **Coral Island snorkeling Phuket** experiences are suitable for beginners, families, and first-time island explorers.\n\nThis guide covers everything you need to know about visiting **Koh Hae Phuket**, including beaches, snorkeling spots, how to reach, best time to visit, and practical travel tips.\n\nPlan your Tropical Thailand Tour here\n\n### Why Visit Coral Island from Phuket\n### \n- One of the **closest islands to Phuket**\n- Excellent **snorkeling at Coral Island Phuket**\n- Clear waters and visible coral reefs\n- Wide range of **Coral Island water sports Phuket**\n- Ideal for families, couples, and groups\n- Easy half-day trip from Phuket\n\nFor Indian travellers, Coral Island is perfect for those who want an island experience without long travel hours.\n\n\n### Coral Island Phuket Location & Background\n### \n📍 Located south of Phuket near **Chalong Bay**\n- Officially known as **Koh Hae**\n- Part of a protected marine area\n\nCoral Island gets its name from the coral reefs found close to its shores, making it a popular snorkeling destination.\n\nStart planning your Thailand Vacation now\n\n### Beaches, Snorkeling and Activities\n### \nCoral Island offers two main beach areas, each with a different vibe.\n\n#### **Banana Beach Coral Island**\n#### \n- Most popular and lively section\n- Best spot for **snorkeling Coral Island Banana Beach**\n- Clear shallow waters with **tropical fish at Koh Hae**\n- Hub for **parasailing, banana boat, and jet ski** rides\n\n#### **Long Beach Coral Island**\n#### \n- Quieter and more relaxed\n- Beachside restaurants and seating\n- Ideal for swimming and sunbathing\n- Popular **Long Beach Coral Island restaurants**\n\nWhen comparing beaches, **Banana Beach vs Long Beach Coral Island**—Banana Beach is better for activities, while Long Beach is more peaceful.\n\n\n### Best Time to Visit Coral Island Phuket\n### \n**Best Season:**\n\n✔️ November to April (dry season, calm sea)\n\n**Best Time of Day:**\n\n✔️ Morning to early afternoon for clear water visibility\n\nThe **best time to visit Coral Island during the dry season** is ideal for snorkeling and water sports.\n\n\n### How to Reach Coral Island from Chalong Pier\n### \n**From Phuket:**\n\n- Speedboat from **Chalong Pier**\n- Travel time: **15–20 minutes**\n- Included in most **Coral Island day trips from Phuket**\n\nMost visitors book a **Coral Island snorkeling tour by speedboat**, which includes transfers and activities.\n\n\n### Coral Island National Park Fee\n### \n- Coral Island falls under a **marine protected area**\n- **Coral Island Phuket national park fee** may apply\n- Usually collected as part of tour packages\n- Helps support coral conservation\n\n\n### Tours, Tips and Water Sports for Coral Island\n### \n#### Popular Tour Options:\n#### \n- **Coral Island day trip from Phuket Chalong Pier**\n- Half-day snorkeling tours\n- Combo tours with water sports\n\n#### Water Sports Available:\n#### \n- Parasailing\n- Banana boat rides\n- Jet ski rides\n- Snorkeling equipment rentals\n\n#### Travel Tips:\n#### \n- Carry reef-safe sunscreen\n- Wear water shoes for coral areas\n- Follow safety instructions during water sports\n- Avoid touching coral reefs\n\n\n### Explore Coral Island Phuket with India Tour Expeditions\n### \nAt **India Tour Expeditions**, we curate island experiences for Indian travellers.\n\n✔️ **Coral Island Phuket tours**\n\n✔️ Speedboat snorkeling experiences\n\n✔️ Family-friendly island trips\n\n✔️ End-to-end Thailand travel planning\n\n🏝️ Add **Coral Island Phuket (Koh Hae)** to your Phuket itinerary and enjoy one of the island’s most accessible tropical escapes.",
