        "brief": "Panoramic Viewpoint Overlooking Karon, Kata & Kata Noi Beaches",
        "description": "**Karon View Point Phuket**, also known as Khao Sam Haad Three Beaches Hill, is one of the most popular Phuket scenic viewpoints on the island’s west coast. Famous for offering a sweeping panoramic view of Kata Noi, Kata Beach, and Karon Beach in a single frame, this viewpoint is a must-stop for first-time visitors.\n\nOften referred to as the Three Beaches Viewpoint Phuket, Karon View Point is a classic photo stop included in most Phuket sightseeing tours. Overlooking the turquoise waters of the Andaman Sea, the viewpoint is especially loved for its elevated coastal views, sea breeze, and dramatic sunsets.\n\nThis guide covers everything you need to know about visiting **Karon View Point Kata Noi Kata Karon**, including why it’s famous, best time to visit, how to reach, parking details, and nearby cafés.\n\n\n### Why Visit Karon View Point in Phuket\n### \n- One of the most famous **scenic viewpoints in Phuket**\n- Iconic **three beaches panorama** in one view\n- Easy stop on Phuket island tours\n- Excellent **sunset viewpoint on Phuket’s west coast**\n- Free to visit and suitable for all travellers\n- Ideal for quick photography stops\n\nFor Indian travellers, Karon View Point offers stunning visuals without long walking or entry fees.\n\nExplore all Thailand Tour Packages by India Tour Expeditions here!\n\n### Karon View Point Phuket Location & Background\n### \n📍 Located on the coastal road between **Kata Noi Beach and Nai Harn**\n- Locally known as **Khao Sam Haad**\n- Overlooks the Andaman Sea coastline\n\nThe name “Sam Haad” means *three beaches*, referring to the visible coastline from the viewpoint.\n\n\n### Iconic View of Kata Noi, Kata and Karon Beaches\n### \nThe main attraction is the uninterrupted coastal panorama.\n\n\n#### Photo Spots and Sunset Views over the Andaman Sea\n#### \nWhat you’ll experience at the viewpoint:\n\n- **Panoramic view of Kata Noi, Kata and Karon**\n- Clear sightlines on sunny days\n- **Andaman Sea coastal panorama**\n- Dedicated viewing platform and railings\n- One of the most **popular photo stops on Phuket tours**\n\nThe **sunset at Karon View Point** paints the coastline in golden and orange hues, making it a favourite for photographers.\n\n\n### Best Time to Visit Karon View Point Phuket\n### \n**Best Time of Day:**\n\n✔️ Early morning for clear views\n\n✔️ Late afternoon for sunset photography\n\n**Best Season:**\n\n✔️ November to April (dry season)\n\nMany travellers search **best time to visit Karon View Point sunrise sunset** depending on photography preferences.\n\nCurate Amazing Vacation to Thailand with India Tour Expeditions\n\n### Location Between Kata Noi and Nai Harn & How to Reach\n### \n- Located between **Kata Noi Beach and Nai Harn**\n- Easily reachable by taxi, private cab, or scooter\n- Included in most Phuket half-day city tours\n\nTravellers often search **how to reach Karon View Point from Kata or Karon Beach**, as it’s a short drive from both.\n\n\n### Karon View Point Parking and Facilities\n### \n- Small **parking area available**\n- Benches and shaded seating\n- Viewing platform with safety railings\n- No entry fee\n\n✔️ This is a **free viewpoint in Phuket**, perfect for a short stop.\n\n\n### Cafes Near Karon View Point with Sea View\n### \nNearby you’ll find:\n\n- Small cafés and refreshment stalls\n- Drinks and light snacks\n- Sea-view seating areas\n\nThese **cafes near Karon View Point with sea view** make it a relaxing break during sightseeing.\n\n\n### Karon View Point vs Windmill Viewpoint Phuket\n### \n- **Karon View Point**: Best for three-beach panorama\n- **Windmill Viewpoint**: Quieter, closer to Nai Harn, dramatic cliffs\n\nBoth viewpoints offer different perspectives and can be combined in one route.\n\n\n### Tips for Visiting Karon View Point\n### \n- Carry sunglasses and sunscreen\n- Visit on a clear day for best visibility\n- Allocate **15–30 minutes**\n- Combine with Kata, Karon, or Nai Harn Beach\n- Ideal stop for all age groups\n\n\n### Explore Karon View Point with India Tour Expeditions\n### \nAt **India Tour Expeditions**, we curate scenic Phuket sightseeing for Indian travellers.\n\n✔️ Phuket island sightseeing tours\n\n✔️ Scenic viewpoint stops\n\n✔️ Beach & sunset itineraries\n\n✔️ Thailand tour packages from India\n\n🌊 Add **Karon View Point Phuket (Khao Sam Haad)** to your Thaialnd itinerary and enjoy one of the island’s most iconic coastal panoramas.",
