        "name": "Carnival Magic Park",
        "brief": "Thailand’s Largest Night Carnival",
        "description": "**Carnival Magic Park Phuket** is one of Thailand’s most spectacular evening attractions, offering a colourful blend of lights, parades, performances, and Thai-inspired carnival celebrations. Located in **Kamala**, **Carnival Magic Phuket** is often described as a “Kingdom of Lights,” featuring millions of illuminated installations spread across a massive theme park.\n\nDesigned as a nighttime-only experience, **Carnival Magic theme park Thailand** showcases grand parades, interactive zones, dining areas, and record-breaking light displays. It is especially popular with families, couples, and travellers looking for unique **things to do in Phuket at night** beyond beaches and nightlife.\n\nThis guide covers everything you need to know about **Carnival Magic Kamala Phuket**, including highlights, best time to visit, location, tickets, and family travel tips.\n\nPlan your family vacation to Thailand with India Tour\n\n### Why Visit Carnival Magic in Kamala Phuket\n### \n- One of Phuket’s most unique **night-time theme parks**\n- Home to the famous **Kingdom of Lights Phuket**\n- Family-friendly attraction suitable for all age groups\n- Massive illuminated displays and themed zones\n- Easy to combine with **Phuket FantaSea Carnival Magic** visits\n- Ideal evening outing away from beach crowds\n\nFor Indian travellers, Carnival Magic offers a safe, colourful, and visually stunning night experience.\n\nExplore Thailand Tour Package here\n\n### Carnival Magic Phuket Location & Background\n### \n📍 Located in **Kamala, Phuket**\n- Close to **Phuket FantaSea**\n- Purpose-built night theme park focused on Thai carnival culture\n\nCarnival Magic was created as a sister attraction to Phuket FantaSea, focusing on light art, parades, and immersive visual storytelling.\n\n\n### Carnival Magic Phuket Opening Hours and Best Time to Visit\n### \n**Operating Days:**\n\n✔️ Open on select evenings (check schedule in advance)\n\n**Carnival Magic Phuket Opening Hours:**\n\n✔️ **Evening entry onwards**\n\n(Timings may vary by season)\n\nThe **best time to visit Carnival Magic Phuket at night** is after sunset, when the lights and parade zones are fully illuminated.\n\n\n### Highlights and Guinness Record Attractions\n### \nCarnival Magic is known for its scale and visual grandeur.\n\n\n#### River Palace Parade and Kingdom of Lights\n#### \nMajor highlights include:\n\n- **Carnival Magic River Palace Parade** – One of the world’s largest indoor parade shows\n- **Kingdom of Lights Phuket illumination** – Millions of LED lights across themed zones\n- Attractions featured in **Carnival Magic Guinness World Records**\n- Thai carnival-inspired costumes and performances\n- Interactive photo zones and themed streets\n\nThe Kingdom of Lights is the most photographed section of the park.\n\n\n### What to Expect at Carnival Magic Park Phuket\n### \n- Grand illuminated walkways and installations\n- Family-friendly carnival atmosphere\n- Large-scale parade performances\n- Shopping zones and dining areas\n- Structured, well-managed visitor flow\n\nThis makes Carnival Magic ideal for families with kids and senior travellers.\n\n### How to Reach Carnival Magic Park Phuket\n### \n- Located near **Kamala Beach**\n- Easily reachable by taxi or private cab\n- **How to reach Carnival Magic from Patong or Kamala** is straightforward, with short drive times\n- Transfers often included with ticket bookings\n\nMany travellers prefer booking **Carnival Magic Phuket tickets with transfer** for convenience.\n\n\n### Tickets, Timings and Family Tips for Carnival Magic Park\n### \n**Carnival Magic Phuket tickets** vary based on inclusions.\n\nTicket options may include:\n\n- Standard entry tickets\n- Tickets with transfers\n- Combo packages with nearby attractions\n\n### Travel Tips for Carnival Magic Park:\n### \n- Ideal for **families and kids**\n- Allocate **3–4 hours** for the experience\n- Comfortable footwear recommended\n- Arrive early to explore light zones before the parade\n\nMany travellers compare **Carnival Magic vs Fantasea Phuket** — Carnival Magic focuses more on lights and parades, while Fantasea highlights stage performances.\n\n\n### Explore Carnival Magic Phuket with India Tour Expeditions\n### \nAt **India Tour Expeditions**, we curate family-friendly Phuket experiences for Indian travellers.\n\n✔️ **Carnival Magic Phuket tickets**\n\n✔️ Tickets with transfers from Patong & Kamala\n\n✔️ Phuket night attractions and shows\n\n✔️ End-to-end Thailand travel planning\n\n🎆 Add **Carnival Magic Park Phuket** to your Thailand itinerary and experience one of Thailand’s most dazzling nighttime attractions.",
