        "name": "Hanuman World",
        "brief": "Adventure Park with Ziplining, Skywalks & Jungle Experiences",
        "description": "**Hanuman World Phuket** is one of the island’s top adventure attractions, offering an adrenaline-filled experience deep inside Phuket’s lush rainforest. Known as the most popular **Hanuman World zipline Phuket** park, this eco-adventure destination combines high-speed ziplines, sky bridges, canopy walks, and the famous roller zipline through the jungle.\n\nSet within a protected forest area, Hanuman World Skywalk and zipline courses allow visitors to explore the rainforest from above, suspended between towering trees. With professionally designed safety systems and multiple activity levels, Hanuman World Phuket is suitable for beginners, families with older kids, and adventure seekers alike.\n\nThis guide covers everything you need to know about visiting **Hanuman World Zipline Phuket**, including activities, ticket packages, safety rules, transfers, and best time to visit.\n\nStart planning your Thailand Vacation now\n\n### Why Visit Hanuman World in Phuket\n### \n- Phuket’s most popular **rainforest zipline park**\n- Adventure-filled **eco adventure park Phuket**\n- Suitable for first-time zipliners and thrill-seekers\n- High safety standards with professional guides\n- Unique jungle views and nature immersion\n- Easy half-day adventure from Phuket resorts\n\nFor Indian travellers looking to add adventure to their Phuket itinerary, Hanuman World is a top choice.\n\n\n### Hanuman World Phuket Location & Background\n### \n📍 Located in central Phuket, surrounded by rainforest\n- Easily accessible from Patong, Kata, Karon, and Phuket Town\n- Designed as a sustainable, eco-focused adventure park\n\nThe park is named after **Hanuman**, the monkey god, symbolising strength, agility, and movement through forests.\n\n\n### Zipline Courses, Roller Zipline and Skywalk\n### \nHanuman World offers multiple adventure elements in one experience.\n\n\n#### Platforms, Sky Bridges and Abseil Points\n#### \nKey highlights include:\n\n- **32 platforms and 16 ziplines in Phuket** (depending on package)\n- **Longest zipline Phuket** stretches up to **400–500 metres**\n- **Dual zipline and sky bridges** for side-by-side rides\n- **Jungle roller coaster zipline (800m)** – a signature attraction\n- **Canopy walk 40m above rainforest**\n- Optional abseiling and rope challenges\n\nThe combination of speed and height makes Hanuman World one of the most exciting outdoor attractions in Phuket.\n\nExplore all Thaikand Pacakges here!\n\n### Hanuman World Zipline Packages and Tickets\n### \nHanuman World offers multiple packages based on adventure level.\n\n**Popular Packages:**\n\n- 10-platform beginner course\n- 18-platform intermediate course\n- **32-platform full adventure course**\n\nMany travellers book **Hanuman World Phuket tickets with transfers**, which include hotel pickup and drop-off.\n\n\n### Best Time to Visit Hanuman World Phuket\n### \n**Best Season:**\n\n✔️ November to April (dry season)\n\n**Best Time of Day:**\n\n✔️ Morning or early afternoon\n\n The **best time to visit Hanuman World Phuket during the dry season** ensures safer platforms and clearer views.\n\n\n### Location, Transfers and How to Reach\n### \n- Located approx. **30–45 minutes** from major beach areas\n- Easily reachable by taxi or private cab\n- **Hotel transfers included** with most ticket bookings\n\nTransfers make the experience convenient, especially for families and groups.\n\n\n### Safety Rules, Age & Weight Limits\n### \n**Safety Guidelines:**\n\n- Professional safety briefing before activities\n- High-quality harnesses and helmets provided\n- Trained guides accompany every group\n\n**General Limits (may vary by package):**\n\n- Minimum age usually **4–6 years**\n- Weight limit around **120 kg**\n- Participants should be in reasonable physical condition\n\nMany travellers search **Hanuman World weight limit safety gear**, as safety is a top priority at the park.\n\n\n### Visit Tips for Hanuman World Phuket\n### \n- Wear comfortable sportswear and closed shoes\n- Avoid loose accessories\n- Follow guide instructions strictly\n- Bring a change of clothes if needed\n- Allocate **3–4 hours** including transfers\n\nLight snacks and rest areas are available on-site.\n\n\n### Explore Hanuman World Phuket with India Tour Expeditions\n### \nAt **India Tour Expeditions**, we curate adventure experiences for Indian travellers.\n\n✔️ **Hanuman World Phuket zipline packages**\n\n✔️ Tickets with transfers\n\n✔️ Family-friendly and adventure itineraries\n\n✔️ End-to-end Thailand travel planning\n\n🌲 Add **Hanuman World Phuket** to your Thailand itinerary and experience one of Thailand’s most exciting rainforest adventures.",
