        "name": "Hot Spring Khlong Thom",
        "brief": "Natural Hot Spring Pools",
        "description": "**Klong Thom Hot Springs Krabi**, also known as Khlong Thom Hot Spring Thailand or Krabi Hot Springs Namtok Ron, is one of the region’s most relaxing natural attractions. Tucked inside lush rainforest near the Thung Teao Forest, these natural hot springs in Krabi form a series of cascading thermal pools flowing over smooth limestone rock.\n\nOften called the hot stream waterfall Klong Thom, the springs feature naturally sculpted “bathtub” pools filled with mineral-rich thermal water maintained at a soothing 35–42°C. Surrounded by jungle greenery, the site feels like a natural spa and is perfect for unwinding after sightseeing or island hopping.\n\nThis guide covers everything you need to know about visiting **Klong Thom Hot Springs**, including health benefits, water temperature, how to reach from Ao Nang or Krabi Town, opening hours, entrance fees, and safety tips.\n\n\n### Why Visit Khlong Thom Hot Spring in Krabi\n### \n- One of the best **natural hot springs in Krabi**\n- Scenic **jungle hot spring waterfall** setting\n- **Mineral rich thermal pools Krabi** with therapeutic benefits\n- Naturally formed **rock bathtubs hot stream**\n- Ideal for relaxation after beach or island tours\n- Easy to combine with nearby Emerald Pool\n\nFor Indian travellers, Klong Thom offers a peaceful, wellness-focused experience amid nature.\n\n\n### Klong Thom Hot Springs Location & Background\n### \n 📍 Located near **Khlong Thom**, Krabi\n- Close to **Thung Teao Forest Natural Park**\n- Also known locally as **Namtok Ron (Hot Stream Waterfall)**\n\nThe springs are naturally heated underground before emerging as warm cascades through the forest.\n\n\n### Natural Rock Pools, Waterfall and Mineral Benefits\n### \nThe highlight of Klong Thom is soaking in its naturally warm pools.\n\n#### Water Temperature, Health Beliefs and Nearby Cool Stream\n#### \nWhat makes the experience special:\n\n- **35–40°C hot spring water** flowing continuously\n- Rich in **therapeutic mineral salts hot springs**\n- Believed to help with muscle relaxation and circulation\n- Smooth limestone pools shaped like bathtubs\n- Cool freshwater stream nearby to balance body temperature\n\nVisitors typically soak for short intervals, alternating with the cooler stream for comfort.\n\n\n### Best Time to Visit Klong Thom Hot Springs\n### \n**Best Time of Day:**\n\n✔️ Early morning (8:30–10:30 AM)\n\n**Best Season:**\n\n✔️ November to April (dry season)\n\nMany travellers search **best time to visit Krabi hot springs early morning** to avoid crowds and enjoy cooler surroundings.\n\n\n### How to Reach Klong Thom Hot Springs from Ao Nang or Krabi Town\n### \n-  Approx. **1–1.5 hours** from Ao Nang or Krabi Town\n- Taxi or private cab\n- Included in guided sightseeing tours\n\nMost visitors look for **how to reach Klong Thom Hot Springs from Ao Nang Krabi Town**, as public transport is limited.\n\n\n### Combine Klong Thom Hot Springs with Emerald Pool Tour\n### \nA popular option is a combined nature tour.\n\nCommon combinations:\n\n- **Klong Thom Hot Springs + Emerald Pool**\n- Hot Springs + Blue Pool (viewing only)\n- Half-day jungle and forest tour\n\nThe **combine Klong Thom Hot Springs with Emerald Pool tour** option is ideal for first-time visitors.\n\nExplore Thailand with India Tour Expeditions\n\n### Klong Thom Hot Springs Opening Hours and Entrance Fee\n### \n**Opening Hours:**\n\n✔️ **8:30 AM – 6:00 PM**\n\n**Entrance Fee:**\n\n✔️ Approx. **200 Baht per adult**\n\n Fees help maintain the park and surrounding forest area.\n\n\n### Visiting Tips and Safety Guidelines\n### \n**Important Tips:**\n\n- Limit soaking to **15–20 minutes at a time**\n- Wear water-friendly footwear (rocks can be slippery)\n- Carry towels and change of clothes\n- Avoid peak afternoon hours\n- Stay hydrated\n\nFollow **safety tips for Klong Thom Hot Springs** to enjoy the experience comfortably.\n\n\n### Explore Klong Thom Hot Springs with India Tour Expeditions\n### \nAt **India Tour Expeditions**, we curate nature and wellness experiences for Indian travellers.\n\n✔️ **Klong Thom Hot Springs Krabi tours**\n\n✔️ Emerald Pool & forest combinations\n\n✔️ Private transfers and guided trips\n\n✔️ Thailand tour packages from India\n\n♨️ Add **Klong Thom Hot Springs Krabi (Namtok Ron)** to your Thailand itinerary and relax in one of Thailand’s most soothing natural jungle spas.",
