        "id": 907,
        "name": "Wat Kaew Korawaram",
        "brief": "Prominent White Temple with Hilltop Views",
        "description": "**Wat Kaew Korawaram Krabi**, often referred to as the **Krabi White Temple**, is one of the most peaceful and visually striking temples in Krabi Town. Perched on a small hill above the city, this elegant blue-white temple complex offers calm city views, beautiful architecture, and a quiet spiritual atmosphere away from Krabi’s beaches.\n\nUnlike adventure-heavy attractions, **Wat Kaew Krabi Town** is ideal for travellers looking to slow down and experience local culture. With its **naga-lined staircase**, golden Buddha ordination hall, and manicured gardens, the temple is a popular stop for those exploring **Krabi city temples**, especially before or after visiting the night market.\n\nThis guide covers everything you need to know about visiting **Wat Kaew Korawaram**, including history, highlights, opening hours, how to reach, and nearby attractions to combine.\n\n\n### Why Visit Wat Kaew Korawaram Krabi\n### \n- One of the **main temples in Krabi Town**\n- Known for its **blue-white architecture and hilltop setting**\n- Beautiful **naga staircase and golden Buddha**\n- Calm alternative to Tiger Cave Temple’s strenuous climb\n- Free entry and easy access from the city\n- Perfect cultural stop before the **Krabi Night Market**\n\nFor travellers staying in Krabi Town or doing a city walk, **Wat Kaew Korawaram** fits easily into a relaxed itinerary.\n\n\n### Wat Kaew Korawaram Location & Background\n### \n- 📍 **Wat Kaew Korawaram Krabi Town**\n- Located near the city centre on a small hill\n- Close to government buildings and local neighbourhoods\n\nThe temple holds **royal monastery status** and reflects a blend of **Thai and Chinese architectural influences**, which is common in southern Thailand.\n\n\n### Naga Stairs, Golden Buddha and Ordination Hall\n### \nThe most recognisable feature of the temple is its **serpent (naga) staircase** leading up to the main hall.\n\n**Key Highlights Inside the Temple**\n\n- Blue-white temple exterior with gold accents\n- **Golden Buddha** inside the ordination hall\n- Wall murals depicting Buddhist teachings\n- Elevated position offering views over Krabi Town\n\nThe climb is short and gentle, making it suitable for **families and senior travellers**.\n\n\n### Gardens, Murals and Photography Spots\n### \nWat Kaew Korawaram is appreciated as much for its calm surroundings as for its religious importance.\n\nWhat visitors enjoy:\n\n- Peaceful temple gardens and shaded benches\n- Clean, quiet atmosphere with fewer tourists\n- Great photo spots along the staircase and temple facade\n- Morning light reflecting beautifully off the white walls\n\nIt’s a lovely place to pause during a **Krabi Town walking route**.\n\n\n### Free Entry, Opening Hours, Location and Access\n### \n **Entry Fee:**\n\n**Free entry** (donations welcome)\n\n**Opening Hours:**\n\nDaily from **8:00 AM to 5:00 PM**\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Shoulders and knees covered\n- Avoid sleeveless tops and short shorts\n- Light scarves are useful if visiting after the beach\n\n**How to Reach Wat Kaew Korawaram**\n\n- Easy access from **Krabi Town**\n- 20–30 minutes from **Ao Nang** by taxi or Grab\n- Walkable from Krabi Town hotels and night market area\n\n\n### Best Time to Visit Wat Kaew Korawaram\n### \n✔️ **Early morning** for quiet prayers and soft light\n\n✔️ Late afternoon for cooler weather\n\n❌ Midday can be hot due to open steps\n\nMany travellers visit **Wat Kaew Krabi** before sunset, then walk to the **Krabi Town Night Market** nearby.\n\n\n### Wat Kaew Korawaram vs Tiger Cave Temple\n### \n**Wat Kaew Korawaram** is:\n\n- Easy to access\n- Calm and city-based\n- Ideal for short cultural visits\n\n**Tiger Cave Temple** is:\n\n- A strenuous climb (1,237 steps)\n- Best for adventure seekers\n- Located outside Krabi Town\n\nIf you want **culture without a tough hike**, Wat Kaew is the better choice.\n\n### Combine Wat Kaew with Nearby Attractions\n### \nPopular combinations include:\n\n- **Wat Kaew Korawaram + Krabi Town Night Market**\n- Wat Kaew + riverfront walk\n- Wat Kaew + Tiger Cave Temple (same day)\n\nIt works well as part of a **Krabi city sightseeing half-day plan**.\n\n\n### Visit Wat Kaew Korawaram with India Tour Expeditions\n### \nAt **India Tour Expeditions**, we design Krabi itineraries that balance beaches with culture.\n\n✔️ Krabi Town temple walks\n\n✔️ Wat Kaew + Night Market combo\n\n✔️ Comfortable pacing for families\n\n✔️ Ideal add-on to island-hopping trips\n\n🌴 Add **Wat Kaew Korawaram** to your Krabi travel plan for a peaceful cultural break during your Krabi holiday.",
