        "id": 837,
        "name": "Krabi Town Night Market",
        "brief": "Local Night Market for Street Food, Shopping & Live Performances",
        "description": "The **Krabi Town Night Market**, also known as the Krabi Weekend Night Market or Krabi Walking Street Market, is one of the most authentic evening experiences in Krabi. Set around Maharaj 8 Road, this lively market runs every Friday, Saturday, and Sunday evening, offering a vibrant mix of street food, handmade crafts, live music, and local performances.\n\nUnlike the more touristy Ao Nang markets, the **Krabi Town Street Food Market** has a strong local character, attracting residents as well as travellers. The relaxed atmosphere, affordable food, and cultural performances make it a must-visit for anyone wanting to experience Krabi beyond beaches and islands.\n\nThis guide covers everything you need to know about visiting the **Krabi Walking Street Night Market**, including why it’s worth visiting, what to eat, what to buy, how to reach it, and useful tips.\n\n### Why Visit Krabi Town Weekend Night Market\n### \n- One of the most **authentic night markets in Krabi**\n- Strong local vibe compared to Ao Nang markets\n- Wide variety of Thai street food\n- Live music and cultural performances\n- Affordable prices and casual atmosphere\n- Great evening activity after island tours\n\nFor Indian travellers, it’s a perfect way to experience **local Krabi nightlife without clubs or bars**.\n\n\n### Krabi Town Night Market Location & Background\n### \n📍 **Maharaj 8 Road Night Market Krabi**\n- Located in **Krabi Town**, near the riverfront\n- Easy to combine with a Krabi Town evening walk\n\nThe market area transforms into a pedestrian-only walking street during market hours.\n\n\n### Street Food, Drinks and Live Entertainment\n### \nFood is the main highlight of the Krabi Town Night Market. Popular food options include:\n\n- Classic **Thai street food stalls in Krabi Town**\n- Grilled seafood and skewers\n- Pad Thai, fried rice, and noodles\n- Fresh fruit shakes and desserts\n- **Cheap cocktails and snacks at Krabi night market**\n\nMost dishes are affordable, making it easy to sample multiple items in one visit. Throughout the evening, enjoy **live music and local performances**, including acoustic bands, dance shows, and cultural acts.\n\n\n### Shopping for Souvenirs and Local Crafts\n### \nBeyond food, the market offers unique shopping.\n\nThings to buy include:\n\n- Handmade jewellery and accessories\n- Clothing and beachwear\n- Local artwork and souvenirs\n- Thai handicrafts and gift items\n\nThe **handmade crafts and souvenirs at Krabi Walking Street** are more locally produced than those in tourist hubs.\n\n\n### Opening Days & Timings\n### \n**Market Days:**\n\n✔️ Friday, Saturday & Sunday\n\n**Opening Hours:**\n\n✔️ **5:00 PM – 10:00 PM**\n\nMany travellers look for **Krabi weekend night market opening hours 17:00–22:00** when planning their evening.\n\n\n### How to Reach Krabi Town Night Market\n### \n- Taxi or tuk-tuk from Ao Nang (20–25 minutes)\n- Scooter rental\n- Included in some Krabi Town evening visits\n\nMany travellers search **how to reach Krabi Town Night Market from Ao Nang**, as it’s slightly away from the beach areas.\n\n\n### Krabi Town Night Market vs Ao Nang Night Market\n### \n- **Krabi Town Night Market**: Local, cultural, relaxed\n- **Ao Nang Night Market**: Tourist-focused, closer to beaches\n\nFor a more authentic experience, Krabi Town is the better choice.\n\n\n### Best Time to Visit Krabi Walking Street\n### \n- Arrive early (around **5:30–6:00 PM**)\n- Easier to explore before peak crowds\n- Better seating availability for food stalls\n\nMany visitors look for the **best time to visit Krabi Walking Street arrive early** for a comfortable experience.\n\n\n### Tips for Visiting Krabi Town Night Market\n### \n- Carry cash (small vendors may not accept cards)\n- Wear comfortable footwear\n- Try local specialities instead of international food\n- Keep belongings secure in crowded areas\n- Plan dinner here to avoid restaurant queues\n\n\n### Explore Krabi Nightlife with India Tour Expeditions\n### \nAt **India Tour Expeditions**, we curate well-rounded Krabi itineraries for Indian travellers.\n\n✔️ Krabi Town evening visits\n\n✔️ Food and cultural experiences\n\n✔️ Island tours + local exploration\n\n✔️ Thailand tour packages from India\n\nAdd the **Krabi Town Night Market** to your Krabi itinerary and enjoy one of the most authentic local experiences in southern Thailand.",
