        "name": "Haad Rin Beach",
        "brief": "Famous for hosting the monthly Full Moon Party",
        "description": "**Haad Rin Beach Koh Phangan** is Thailand’s most famous party beach and the global epicentre of the legendary **Full Moon Party**. Located at the southern tip of Koh Phangan, **Haad Rin Beach Thailand** transforms every month into a massive beach rave, attracting thousands of travellers from around the world.\n\nThe area is divided into two main beaches—**Haad Rin Nok Beach** (Sunrise Beach), where the Full Moon Party takes place, and **Haad Rin Nai** (Sunset Beach), which is quieter and more relaxed. While **Haad Rin nightlife** is world-famous, the beach also offers calm daytime vibes, swimming, and scenic sunrise views.\n\nThis guide covers everything you need to know about **Haad Rin Beach Full Moon Party**, daytime beach experiences, how to reach Haad Rin, accommodation tips, and safety advice.\n\n\n### Why Haad Rin Beach is Famous in Thailand\n### \n- Host of the world-famous **Full Moon Party Thailand**\n- Iconic **Haad Rin Beach party atmosphere**\n- Vibrant nightlife with beach bars and DJs\n- Stunning **sunrise views at Haad Rin Nok**\n- Mix of party nights and relaxed daytime beach life\n- Bucket-list destination for young travellers\n\nFor Indian travellers seeking nightlife and social travel experiences, Haad Rin Beach is unmatched.\n\nVisit Bangkok and Pattaya with Our Itinerary\n\n### Haad Rin Beach Location & Background\n### \n📍 Located on the **southern tip of Koh Phangan**\n- Divided into **Haad Rin Nok (Sunrise Beach)** and **Haad Rin Nai (Sunset Beach)**\n- Main hub for nightlife and beach parties on the island\n\nHaad Rin was once a quiet beach village before becoming a global party destination.\n\n\n### Full Moon Party Experience on Haad Rin Sunrise Beach\n### \nThe **Full Moon Party Haad Rin Beach** is the main attraction.\n\n#### Music, Neon Paint, Fire Shows and Buckets\n#### \nWhat to expect on party nights:\n\n- Multiple DJ stages across the beach\n- EDM, techno, psytrance, reggae, and hip-hop zones\n- **Neon body paint and fire shows**\n- Famous bucket drinks sold along the beach\n- Thousands of partygoers dancing till sunrise\n\nOn **Haad Rin Full Moon Party dates**, the entire beach turns into an open-air festival.\n\nDiscover Bangkok and Pattaya with your family\n\n### Daytime Beach Vibes, Swimming and Nearby Viewpoints\n### \nOutside party nights, Haad Rin has a completely different feel.\n\nDaytime highlights:\n\n- Calm mornings after sunrise\n- Swimming and beach relaxation\n- Cafés and small restaurants along the shore\n- Short walks to viewpoints around the peninsula\n- Quieter experience on non-party days\n\n **Haad Rin Beach quiet days vs party nights** feel like two entirely different destinations.\n\n\n### Best Time to Visit Haad Rin Beach\n### \n**For Parties:**\n\n✔️ Full Moon nights (check dates in advance)\n\n**For Relaxed Beach Time:**\n\n✔️ Non-party days, especially mid-week\n\n Early mornings offer the best **sunrise views at Haad Rin Nok Beach**.\n\n\n### How to Get to Haad Rin Beach from Koh Samui or Surat Thani\n### \n**Step-by-step access:**\n\n- Fly to **Koh Samui** or Surat Thani\n- Take a ferry to **Koh Phangan**\n- Use taxi boats or songthaews to reach Haad Rin\n\nMany travellers search **how to get to Haad Rin Beach from Koh Samui**, as ferries run frequently during Full Moon events.\n\n\n### Haad Rin Beach Accommodation Tips\n### \n- Book early for **Haad Rin Beach accommodation for Full Moon Party**\n- Beachfront stays are lively but noisy\n- For better rest, stay slightly away from Sunrise Beach\n- Budget hostels, resorts, and hotels available\n\nAccommodation prices rise significantly around Full Moon dates.\n\n\n### Safety Tips for Haad Rin Full Moon Party\n### \n- Drink responsibly (bucket drinks are strong)\n- Avoid swimming at night\n- Wear footwear due to broken glass\n- Keep valuables waterproof and secure\n- Follow local authorities and event staff instructions\n\n **Safety tips for Haad Rin Full Moon Party** are essential for a smooth experience.\n\n\n### Explore Haad Rin Beach with India Tour Expeditions\n### \nAt **India Tour Expeditions**, we help Indian travellers plan Koh Phangan trips with ease.\n\n✔️ Koh Phangan & Full Moon Party planning\n\n✔️ Ferry coordination from Koh Samui\n\n✔️ Island-hopping and beach stays\n\n✔️ Thailand nightlife itineraries from India\n\n🌊 Add **Haad Rin Beach Koh Phangan** to your Thailand itinerary and experience Thailand’s most iconic party beach—by night and by sunrise.",
